# Claude.ai connector tools denied to Claude ship and scout workers.
# docs/configuration.md "Claude worker connector deny list" owns the contract;
# bin/fm-exclude-tools-lib.sh parses this file for bin/fm-spawn.sh.
#
# One exact tool name per line; blank lines and # comment lines are allowed.
# List only tools that send, post, schedule, share, create, edit, delete,
# trash, transition, or otherwise change state outside the worktree.
# Never list a get, list, search, read, fetch, query, or export tool.
# Tools that take a read-or-write action argument are left allowed and are
# reviewed by hand, noted beside their connector below.

